      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"629092d3b3c335df\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe WITI TV Tower is a lattice ... (329 m) tower built in 1962 was for many years the tallest free-standing tower in the United States until the <strong>Stratosphere Tower</strong> was built in 1996....\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"629092d3b3c335df\">>>",
