      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"45cf35f240a51d7b\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe Eiffel Tower is perhaps the most famous example of a lattice tower and was the tallest lattice tower in the world for a record 68 years, from <strong>1889 to 1957</strong>.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"45cf35f240a51d7b\">>>",
